In Spelunking, you acquire a variety of Treasure, which you use to improve your delvers, buy [[Construction]] upgrades or other things throughout the game. You can have up to 8 Spelunkers, who can perform two actions under Delve menu; Jump or Learn.
==Treasure==
Bags have three stats:

[[File:value_icon.png|25px]] '''Value''': bags become higher rarity every power of 10 Value. Upgrading Value stat and Learning perk #2 on spelunkers increases its gain rate.

[[File:treasure_icon.png|25px]] '''Treasure''': what type of Treasure is in the bag and its quantity.

[[File:rare_chance_icon.png|25px]] '''Rare Chance''': every Treasure in a bag has a low chance to become a Treasure one tier higher, as indicated by the gold star percentage. This phenomenon can stack upon itself, resulting in a Treasure two tiers higher. The final two Treasures, The Mark and Temper Obol can only be acquired through Rare Chance. There are four [[Cards/Spelunking|Spelunking Cards]] that can improve these odds.
